WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:11.579
"Hmph!" Sara thought.

2
00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:21.079
"Babysitting Sam is hard!"

3
00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:25.355
Sara found Rex.

4
00:00:25.356 --> 00:00:32.233
He was making a tower.

5
00:00:32.234 --> 00:00:35.732
"This is Sam," Sara said.

6
00:00:35.733 --> 00:00:38.898
"Hi, Sam," Rex said.

7
00:00:38.899 --> 00:00:43.252
"Can you babysit him?" Sara asked.

8
00:00:43.253 --> 00:00:49.617
"I'm looking for his mom."

9
00:00:49.618 --> 00:00:52.580
"Sure," Rex said.

10
00:00:52.581 --> 00:00:56.150
Sara went away.

11
00:00:56.151 --> 00:00:59.876
Sam looked at Rex's tower.

12
00:00:59.877 --> 00:01:02.960
"What is that?" Sam asked.

13
00:01:02.961 --> 00:01:07.118
"A tower," Rex said.

14
00:01:07.119 --> 00:01:12.673
Sam kicked the tower. Crash!

15
00:01:12.674 --> 00:01:16.264
"Why did you do that?" Rex cried.

16
00:01:16.265 --> 00:01:19.195
"Ha-ha!" Sam laughed.

17
00:01:19.196 --> 00:01:23.503
"Grr!" Rex said.

18
00:01:23.504 --> 00:01:30.868
"It's not funny!"

19
00:01:30.869 --> 00:01:34.964
Rex found Sid.

20
00:01:34.965 --> 00:01:38.154
"This is Sam," Rex said.

21
00:01:38.155 --> 00:01:41.449
"Can you babysit him?"

22
00:01:41.450 --> 00:01:48.957
"Sure," Sid said.

23
00:01:48.958 --> 00:01:59.761
"Come with me, Sam."

24
00:01:59.762 --> 00:02:03.474
Sid gave Sam some berries.

25
00:02:03.475 --> 00:02:05.943
Sam smashed the berries.

26
00:02:05.944 --> 00:02:08.379
Berry juice flew.

27
00:02:08.380 --> 00:02:17.676
Sam laughed.

28
00:02:17.677 --> 00:02:24.165
"Don't smash the berries," Sid said.

29
00:02:24.166 --> 00:02:27.216
"Aw," Sam groaned.

30
00:02:27.217 --> 00:02:31.924
"You're not fun!"

